B.a_C=new A.dw("A document will not open","Usually access was removed \u2014 you left the group, were removed from it, or the file was deleted. Pull to refresh; if the file is gone from the list, it was deleted.",!1)
B.a_H=new A.dw("The app says it is offline","Groups, documents and the audit log need a connection. Burn Notes and Burn Files need one too, to upload. Your private scratchpad keeps working, and syncs when you are back.",!1)
B.a_m=new A.dw("Signed out unexpectedly","If unusual security signals are detected on your account, the app asks you to sign in again. That is a refresh, not a lockout \u2014 signing back in clears the flag if the risk has passed.",!1)
